      <data key="d5">1754890550</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Brown Rice">
      <data key="d0">Brown Rice</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Brown rice is described as having a nutty flavor and being a better carb choice than white rice due to its slower release of energy and higher fiber content.&lt;SEP&gt;Brown rice is mentioned as a complex and unrefined carb that causes a slower rise in blood sugar levels compared to refined versions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-58067acb0a4b21e48e826dd7e97d86a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-432b00aa4a62ed1cc5b80a9b6a970a9c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890550</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Pasta">
      <data key="d0">Pasta</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Cooked pasta can be stirred into the veggie mixture for a quick meal, indicating its use as a staple ingredient in some recipes.&lt;SEP&gt;Pasta is a type of starchy food that is often eaten in large portions - usually the equivalent of six slices of bread. It can be combined with other starches like potatoes and bread at a meal."&lt;&lt;关系描述&gt;&gt;"Starchy foods, portion control&lt;SEP&gt;Pasta, like other starchy foods, contains a lot of carbs and should be consumed in controlled portions to avoid excessive intake of carbs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-58067acb0a4b21e48e826dd7e97d86a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6699a5c79683213ff4dea6e14b493c72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bea3aa6519bdbc96a177e5b01313158</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890550</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Potatoes">
      <data key="d0">Potatoes</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Potatoes are noted as starchy-vegetables that contain a lot of carbs and should be eaten in moderation.&lt;SEP&gt;Potatoes are starchy vegetables that can be combined with other starches like bread to increase carb intake."&lt;&lt;关系描述&gt;&gt;"Starchy foods, combination of carbs</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-58067acb0a4b21e48e826dd7e97d86a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6699a5c79683213ff4dea6e14b493c72</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890550</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Pap">
      <data key="d0">Pap</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Pap is a starchy food commonly found in certain regions and is often consumed as part of the diet alongside other carbs like bread or rice. It can be combined with potatoes or pasta at a meal."&lt;&lt;关系描述&gt;&gt;"Starchy foods, portion control&lt;SEP&gt;Pap is included among the list of starchy foods, providing high levels of carbs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-58067acb0a4b21e48e826dd7e97d86a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6699a5c79683213ff4dea6e14b493c72</data>
