    </node>
    <node id="Starchy Foods">
      <data key="d0">Starchy Foods</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Starchy foods include pasta, rice, potatoes, bread and pap, which contain a lot of carbs. They are often consumed in too large portions."&lt;&lt;关系描述&gt;&gt;"Description not available in text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6699a5c79683213ff4dea6e14b493c72</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890552</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Community Healthcare Workers (CHWs)">
      <data key="d0">Community Healthcare Workers (CHWs)</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">CHWs are community health workers trained to raise awareness and promote NCD prevention initiatives in the communities they serve.&lt;SEP&gt;Community Healthcare Workers (CHWs) are frontline health workers whose roles include screening for diabetes and recognizing symptoms, yet their potential remains untapped.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0c87b51ba48af7d085119b219b21046f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-809adfa0a14ab6fe4990c753d1ffe33e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890552</data>
    </node>
    <node id="WHO Best Buys">
      <data key="d0">WHO Best Buys</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The WHO Best Buys are cost-effective interventions and policy measures identified by the World Health Organization (WHO) for combating NCDs including diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;WHO Best Buys are public health interventions such as promoting healthy diets and physical activity.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0c87b51ba48af7d085119b219b21046f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-809adfa0a14ab6fe4990c753d1ffe33e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890553</data>
    </node>
    <node id="National Strategic Plan">
      <data key="d0">National Strategic Plan</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The National Strategic Plan is a document that outlines strategies for the prevention and control of non-communicable diseases (NCDs), including diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Strategic Plan outlines goals and initiatives for addressing the diabetes epidemic, including 90-60-50 targets.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Strategic Plan is a framework for addressing unhealthy diets through various strategies and objectives.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6a3470aab48da10bd8a36978481943e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bbcda5be08e321e58b42b986d804d9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-809adfa0a14ab6fe4990c753d1ffe33e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754897476</data>
    </node>
