      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Lean proteins like eggs and chicken are suggested to be included in the diet for their nutritional benefits. They can be used as alternatives to processed meats or snacks."&lt;&lt;关系描述&gt;&gt;"Balanced diet, protein sources</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6699a5c79683213ff4dea6e14b493c72</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
