      <data key="d0">Avocado</data>
      <data key="d1">food</data>
      <data key="d2">Avocado is a healthy fat source that can be included in meals instead of chips and other high-carb snack options."&lt;&lt;关系描述&gt;&gt;"Healthy fats, portion control&lt;SEP&gt;Avocado is mentioned as a food that can be served with the soup or meal described in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Avocado is mentioned as being delicious served with chicken and barley soup.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-92bd7d456fa9b5f0c564afd5dd3bb0af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-432b00aa4a62ed1cc5b80a9b6a970a9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6699a5c79683213ff4dea6e14b493c72</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
