      <data key="d0">Crisps</data>
      <data key="d1">food</data>
      <data key="d2">Salty snacks like crisps are not as nutritious as alternatives such as raw nuts or vegetables. They are often consumed in large quantities and can increase carb intake."&lt;&lt;关系描述&gt;&gt;"Unhealthy snack options, portion control</data>
