    <node id="National Coordinating Body for NCDs">
      <data key="d0">National Coordinating Body for NCDs</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A proposed body to streamline efforts and coordinate resources towards achieving the objectives of the National Strategic Plan (NSP) related to NCDs including diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0c87b51ba48af7d085119b219b21046f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890555</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIABETIC PRODUCTS">
      <data key="d0">DIABETIC PRODUCTS</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Diabetic products may be marketed as sugar-free but often contain other types of sugars that can still affect blood sugar levels. Reading labels is important for people with diabetes."&lt;&lt;关系描述&gt;&gt;"Nutritional value, label reading</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6699a5c79683213ff4dea6e14b493c72</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890555</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Diabetes education programme in South Africa">
      <data key="d0">Diabetes education programme in South Africa</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Currently, there is no standardised structured programme for educating individuals with diabetes on self-management and healthy lifestyles.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0c87b51ba48af7d085119b219b21046f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890555</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Workforce skilled in diabetes">
      <data key="d0">Workforce skilled in diabetes</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">There is a shortage of healthcare workers trained to effectively prevent and manage diabetes, particularly through task-shifting to dedicated nurses.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0c87b51ba48af7d085119b219b21046f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890556</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Artificial Sweeteners">
      <data key="d0">Artificial Sweeteners</data>
      <data key="d1">food</data>
      <data key="d2">Artificial sweeteners are available to reduce sugar intake but may not completely eliminate carbs from the diet. Their use should be carefully monitored by people with diabetes."&lt;&lt;关系描述&gt;&gt;"Sugar reduction, blood sugar management</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6699a5c79683213ff4dea6e14b493c72</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890556</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Diabetes nurse educators">
      <data key="d0">Diabetes nurse educators</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">These are specialized healthcare professionals who lack recognition and integration into the public healthcare system in South Africa but are recognized in the private sector for their role in diabetes education.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0c87b51ba48af7d085119b219b21046f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
