      <data key="d0">Non-Starchy Veggies</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Non-starchy vegetables are recommended to be included in meals as they are low in carbs and high in nutrients."&lt;&lt;关系描述&gt;&gt;"Description not available in text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6699a5c79683213ff4dea6e14b493c72</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
