    </node>
    <node id="Seasonal Fruits">
      <data key="d0">Seasonal Fruits</data>
      <data key="d1">food</data>
      <data key="d2">Seasonal fruits are suggested for their nutritional value and help in managing blood sugar levels compared to processed snacks. They provide important nutrients like minerals, vitamins, and fiber."&lt;&lt;关系描述&gt;&gt;"Nutritional value, blood sugar management</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6699a5c79683213ff4dea6e14b493c72</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
