    </node>
    <node id="Processed Drinks">
      <data key="d0">Processed Drinks</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Processed drinks include sugary beverages such as drinking yoghurts, flavoured milk, fruit juices, fizzy and energy drinks, cordials, and waters, iced teas, and hot chocolate. These can cause unexpected rises in blood sugar levels."&lt;&lt;关系描述&gt;&gt;"Description not available in text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6699a5c79683213ff4dea6e14b493c72</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890556</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Diabetes self-management education">
      <data key="d0">Diabetes self-management education</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Education programs focused on empowering individuals with diabetes to effectively manage their condition through healthy lifestyle changes and understanding medication regimens.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0c87b51ba48af7d085119b219b21046f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890557</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Alcoholic Beverages">
      <data key="d0">Alcoholic Beverages</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Alcoholic beverages are consumed by people with diabetes but should be done in moderation to avoid drastic rises in blood sugar levels or hypoglycaemia. Beer, cider, and other alcoholic drinks can contain carbs."&lt;&lt;关系描述&gt;&gt;"Description not available in text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6699a5c79683213ff4dea6e14b493c72</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890557</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Cooking from the Heart">
      <data key="d0">Cooking from the Heart</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">'Cooking from the heart' is mentioned in the text but does not provide additional details about its meaning or content.&lt;SEP&gt;Cooking from the Heart is a way of eating that emphasizes using unprocessed, fresh ingredients and healthy cooking methods. It aims to help manage blood sugar levels by making better food choices."&lt;&lt;关系描述&gt;&gt;"Description not available in text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-432b00aa4a62ed1cc5b80a9b6a970a9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6699a5c79683213ff4dea6e14b493c72</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890557</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Plate Model">
      <data key="d0">Plate Model</data>
      <data key="d1">tool</data>
      <data key="d2">The Plate Model is a tool used to control portions and make better food choices. It can be applied when eating out as well as at home. The model divides the plate into sections for different types of foods."&lt;&lt;关系描述&gt;&gt;"Portion control, healthy eating&lt;SEP&gt;The Plate Model is a visual guide for choosing the right portions of vegetables, starch, fats, and protein to ensure balanced meals.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bd33b3de797d4c6bf9bce23ddb306beb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6699a5c79683213ff4dea6e14b493c72</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890557</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Diabetes Nurse Educators">
      <data key="d0">Diabetes Nurse Educators</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Diabetes Nurse Educators refer to healthcare professionals specialized in providing diabetes education and support. They are recognized and integrated into the private sector but lack recognition in the public sector.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d396dda3ce9b0c2f87b5d6ddb9d013b1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890557</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Non-Profit Organizations (NPOs)">
      <data key="d0">Non-Profit Organizations (NPOs)</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">NPOs are organizations dedicated to social welfare or public benefit. They play a role in community education and awareness campaigns regarding diabetes but require additional support for their operations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d396dda3ce9b0c2f87b5d6ddb9d013b1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890557</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Nutrition Information Panel">
      <data key="d0">Nutrition Information Panel</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The Nutrition Information Panel is a section on food labels that lists the amount of various nutrients per 100g and suggested serving size.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5ee0362fd9870828ed03fba0664efdf</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890558</data>
    </node>
    <node id="World Health Organization (WHO) / Department of Health">
      <data key="d0">World Health Organization (WHO) / Department of Health</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Department of Health is part of the government responsible for implementing policies and programs to address non-communicable diseases, including diabetes. It plays a crucial role in ensuring continuity and expansion of diabetes education initiatives.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d396dda3ce9b0c2f87b5d6ddb9d013b1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890558</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Tshwane Insulin Project">
      <data key="d0">Tshwane Insulin Project</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Tshwane Insulin Project is an example of a successful diabetes education program implemented at the University of Pretoria.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d396dda3ce9b0c2f87b5d6ddb9d013b1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890558</data>
    </node>
    <node id="'GREAT' Programme">
      <data key="d0">'GREAT' Programme</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The 'GREAT' Programme, associated with Stellenbosch University and the Department of Health, has been a part of the successful initiatives in diabetes education.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d396dda3ce9b0c2f87b5d6ddb9d013b1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890559</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COUPLE's Project">
      <data key="d0">COUPLE's Project</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">COUPLE's Project by the Chronic Disease Initiative for Africa at the University of Cape Town is another example of effective diabetes education projects that have contributed to addressing the burden of diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d396dda3ce9b0c2f87b5d6ddb9d013b1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890559</data>
    </node>
    <node id="STEP 1: READ THE PANEL">
      <data key="d0">STEP 1: READ THE PANEL</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Step 1 involves reading the Nutrition Information Panel to assess if a product is a healthy option based on the listed nutrient values.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5ee0362fd9870828ed03fba0664efdf</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890559</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Basic &amp; Advanced Diabetes Courses">
      <data key="d0">Basic &amp; Advanced Diabetes Courses</data>
      <data key="d1">course</data>
      <data key="d2">These courses are educational programs designed to train healthcare workers in diabetes management and care. They are implemented at Groote Schuur Hospital, providing comprehensive training for health professionals involved in diabetes care.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d396dda3ce9b0c2f87b5d6ddb9d013b1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890559</data>
    </node>
    <node id="STEP 2: READ THE LIST OF INGREDIENTS">
      <data key="d0">STEP 2: READ THE LIST OF INGREDIENTS</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Step 2 involves reading the ingredients list in order of quantity and looking for added sugar, fat, and salt.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5ee0362fd9870828ed03fba0664efdf</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890559</data>
    </node>
    <node id="quick acting insulin">
      <data key="d0">quick acting insulin</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">"Quick acting insulin is a type of medication used to manage blood glucose levels in people with diabetes." description not available in text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5ee0362fd9870828ed03fba0664efdf</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890559</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Community Health Workers (CHWs)">
      <data key="d0">Community Health Workers (CHWs)</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">CHWs are community-based health workers who provide education, support, and outreach related to chronic diseases like diabetes. They play a critical role in addressing the needs of individuals living with diabetes at the grassroots level.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d396dda3ce9b0c2f87b5d6ddb9d013b1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890559</data>
    </node>
    <node id="carbohydrate counting">
      <data key="d0">carbohydrate counting</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Carbohydrate counting involves monitoring the total or glycaemic amount of carbohydrates consumed, especially important for those who inject quick acting insulin before meals and snacks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5ee0362fd9870828ed03fba0664efdf</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890559</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NSP Goal 3 - Integrated Health Services">
      <data key="d0">NSP Goal 3 - Integrated Health Services</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">This is a goal within the National Strategic Plan (NSP) aimed at ensuring integrated, people-centred health services to prevent and control non-communicable diseases such as diabetes. It outlines key objectives for improving care across primary, secondary, and tertiary levels of the healthcare system.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d396dda3ce9b0c2f87b5d6ddb9d013b1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890559</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Glucose Monitoring Tools">
      <data key="d0">Glucose Monitoring Tools</data>
      <data key="d1">equipment</data>
      <data key="d2">Glucose monitoring tools such as glucometers and testing strips are essential for diabetes management but are frequently unavailable to patients.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d396dda3ce9b0c2f87b5d6ddb9d013b1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890560</data>
    </node>
    <node id="serving size">
      <data key="d0">serving size</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"Serving sizes are indicated on food labels to help consumers understand portion control." description not available in text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5ee0362fd9870828ed03fba0664efdf</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890560</data>
    </node>
    <node id="carbohydrates">
      <data key="d0">carbohydrates</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Carbohydrates are a type of nutrient found in foods and play an important role in the body's energy production, with specific attention paid by those managing diabetes or engaging in carbohydrate counting.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5ee0362fd9870828ed03fba0664efdf</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890560</data>
    </node>
    <node id="sugars">
      <data key="d0">sugars</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Sugars are listed on food labels to help consumers make informed decisions about their sugar intake, especially for individuals carb counting or managing blood glucose levels.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5ee0362fd9870828ed03fba0664efdf</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890560</data>
    </node>
    <node id="dietary fibre">
      <data key="d0">dietary fibre</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"Dietary fiber is a type of carbohydrate found in plant-based foods that promotes digestive health and can be beneficial when aiming for at least 3g per serving." description not available in text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5ee0362fd9870828ed03fba0664efdf</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890560</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Clinical Inertia">
      <data key="d0">Clinical Inertia</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Clinical inertia refers to healthcare providers' tendency to overlook signs requiring referrals, impacting the effective implementation of care pathways.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d396dda3ce9b0c2f87b5d6ddb9d013b1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890560</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Glucose Control">
      <data key="d0">Glucose Control</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Glucose control is a critical aspect of diabetes management and involves achieving optimal blood sugar levels. It requires adherence to care pathways and the use of pharmacological agents.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d396dda3ce9b0c2f87b5d6ddb9d013b1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890561</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Glucometers">
      <data key="d0">Glucometers</data>
      <data key="d1">equipment</data>
      <data key="d2">Glucometers are devices used for measuring blood sugar levels, essential in diabetes management but frequently unavailable to patients.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d396dda3ce9b0c2f87b5d6ddb9d013b1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890561</data>
    </node>
    <node id="sodium (salt)">
      <data key="d0">sodium (salt)</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Sodium or salt content on food labels helps consumers monitor their intake, particularly important for those with specific dietary restrictions or managing blood pressure.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5ee0362fd9870828ed03fba0664efdf</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890561</data>
    </node>
    <node id="saturated fats">
      <data key="d0">saturated fats</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"Saturated fats are listed under fat content on food labels with guidelines to aim for less than 10g per 100g or as low as possible, especially important for milk and yogurt products." description not available in text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5ee0362fd9870828ed03fba0664efdf</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890562</data>
    </node>
    <node id="trans fats">
      <data key="d0">trans fats</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"Trans fats are a type of fat listed under fat content on food labels to be used sparingly with the goal of less than 1g per 100g, especially important for oils and margarines." description not available in text.&lt;SEP&gt;Trans fats are partially hydrogenated oils that can be found in some processed foods; they're known for their negative health effects and are being phased out of many recipes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5ee0362fd9870828ed03fba0664efdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b79825bf243d6abdec856f313bda4e9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890562</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Testing Strips">
      <data key="d0">Testing Strips</data>
      <data key="d1">equipment</data>
      <data key="d2">Testing strips are used with glucometers to measure blood sugar levels and are also frequently unavailable to patients.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d396dda3ce9b0c2f87b5d6ddb9d013b1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890562</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Glycaemic Control">
      <data key="d0">Glycaemic Control</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Glycaemic control involves managing blood sugar levels within target ranges and is crucial for preventing complications in diabetes patients.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d396dda3ce9b0c2f87b5d6ddb9d013b1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890562</data>
    </node>
    <node id="emic control">
      <data key="d0">emic control</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Emic control refers to local or community-based approaches to managing diabetes and related health issues.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f547c1ef7d9fdc3451e37273a2a2eb2c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890562</data>
    </node>
    <node id="target blood pressure and cholesterol levels">
      <data key="d0">target blood pressure and cholesterol levels</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Targeting these parameters is crucial for reducing diabetes complications and mortality.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f547c1ef7d9fdc3451e37273a2a2eb2c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890562</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Poor adherence to care pathways and late referrals">
      <data key="d0">Poor adherence to care pathways and late referrals</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">This issue involves insufficient following of established care pathways and delayed referrals between different levels of healthcare, impacting patient outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f547c1ef7d9fdc3451e37273a2a2eb2c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890562</data>
    </node>
    <node id="margarine">
      <data key="d0">margarine</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"Margarine is a type of spread listed as an ingredient on food labels and can contain animal fat." description not available in text.&lt;SEP&gt;Margarine, a dairy-free spread made to mimic butter, can be an ingredient in baking or cooking, especially in recipes requiring spreads or fats.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5ee0362fd9870828ed03fba0664efdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b79825bf243d6abdec856f313bda4e9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890562</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Chocolate digestive biscuits">
      <data key="d0">Chocolate digestive biscuits</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"Chocolate digestive biscuits are an example of a food product with its ingredients listed, often containing sugar, margarine (with animal fat), milk solids non-fat, flavors, and chocolate." description not available in text.&lt;SEP&gt;Chocolate digestive biscuits are a type of food product with specific ingredients and nutritional information.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5ee0362fd9870828ed03fba0664efdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b79825bf243d6abdec856f313bda4e9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890563</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Delays in intensifying diabetes treatment">
      <data key="d0">Delays in intensifying diabetes treatment</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Clinical inertia leads to delayed escalation of treatments for diabetes patients when their goals are not met.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f547c1ef7d9fdc3451e37273a2a2eb2c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890563</data>
    </node>
    <node id="wheat flour">
      <data key="d0">wheat flour</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"Wheat flour is a component of chocolate digestive biscuits and is used as a primary ingredient in food products." description not available in text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5ee0362fd9870828ed03fba0664efdf</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890563</data>
    </node>
    <node id="milk solids non-fat">
      <data key="d0">milk solids non-fat</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"Milk solids non-fat is an ingredient in chocolate digestive biscuits, often found in dairy-based foods and provides nutritional value without the fat content of milk." description not available in text.&lt;SEP&gt;Milk solids non-fat (MSNF) are the dried and separated components of milk excluding the fat; they're used as a source of protein and other nutrients in food products.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5ee0362fd9870828ed03fba0664efdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b79825bf243d6abdec856f313bda4e9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890563</data>
    </node>
    <node id="flavors">
      <data key="d0">flavors</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"Flavors are added to chocolate digestive biscuits as a sensory component to enhance taste and appeal." description not available in text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5ee0362fd9870828ed03fba0664efdf</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890563</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Limited access to glucose testing tools for self-monitoring of blood glucose">
      <data key="d0">Limited access to glucose testing tools for self-monitoring of blood glucose</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Access to these tools is essential but limited, affecting self-management and ongoing care.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f547c1ef7d9fdc3451e37273a2a2eb2c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890563</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Poor implementation of a diabetes care team approach">
      <data key="d0">Poor implementation of a diabetes care team approach</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Effective multidisciplinary care teams are not fully utilized, leading to gaps in comprehensive patient management.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f547c1ef7d9fdc3451e37273a2a2eb2c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="chocolate">
      <data key="d0">chocolate</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"Chocolate is an ingredient found in chocolate digestive biscuits, contributing to their flavor profile and texture." description not available in text.&lt;SEP&gt;Chocolate is a sweet confection made from cocoa solids, sugar, and other ingredients, often used as a flavoring agent or topping in baking and confections.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5ee0362fd9870828ed03fba0664efdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b79825bf243d6abdec856f313bda4e9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="white bread flour">
      <data key="d0">white bread flour</data>
      <data key="d1">ingredient</data>
      <data key="d2">White bread flour is an ingredient used in baking, often found in wholewheat bread recipes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7b79825bf243d6abdec856f313bda4e9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Health inequities in diabetes">
      <data key="d0">Health inequities in diabetes</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Significant disparities exist between public and private healthcare sectors, exacerbating access issues for individuals living with diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f547c1ef7d9fdc3451e37273a2a2eb2c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="wholewheat flour">
      <data key="d0">wholewheat flour</data>
      <data key="d1">ingredient</data>
      <data key="d2">Wholewheat flour is a type of grain flour made from the entire wheat kernel and is rich in fiber and nutrients.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7b79825bf243d6abdec856f313bda4e9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890565</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Insulin pens">
      <data key="d0">Insulin pens</data>
      <data key="d1">equipment</data>
      <data key="d2">Insulin pens are crucial devices for managing diabetes, but their availability is restricted in certain patient groups in the public sector.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f547c1ef7d9fdc3451e37273a2a2eb2c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890565</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Continuous Glucose Monitoring devices">
      <data key="d0">Continuous Glucose Monitoring devices</data>
      <data key="d1">technology</data>
      <data key="d2">Continuous Glucose Monitoring (CGM) devices represent innovative technology not widely accessible to individuals with diabetes in the public sector.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f547c1ef7d9fdc3451e37273a2a2eb2c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890565</data>
    </node>
    <node id="rye meal">
