    <node id="Discovery Diabetes Care Programme">
      <data key="d0">Discovery Diabetes Care Programme</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Discovery Health has implemented an ecosystem for diabetes care that includes data utilization, proactive care coordination, and patient empowerment for self-management, resulting in tangible benefits.</data>
