    </node>
    <node id="lactose">
      <data key="d0">lactose</data>
      <data key="d1">ingredient</data>
      <data key="d2">Lactose, a disaccharide found in milk, is used as an ingredient in some food products for its sweetening properties.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7b79825bf243d6abdec856f313bda4e9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1754890574</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Global Fund">
      <data key="d0">Global Fund</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Global Fund is a promising avenue for South Africa in terms of accessing funds aimed at health system strengthening or integrating care to address comorbidities related to diabetes.</data>
