    <node id="malt">
      <data key="d0">malt</data>
      <data key="d1">ingredient</data>
      <data key="d2">Malt is derived from germinated grain, often barley, and is used for flavoring and fermentation purposes; it can be added to enhance the taste of baked goods.</data>
