    <node id="Carrots">
      <data key="d0">Carrots</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Carrots are root vegetables that play a significant role in various recipes. In one casserole preparation, they are peeled and thickly sliced to be cooked along with other vegetables. Carrots are also mentioned as an ingredient in a recipe that emphasizes both color enhancement and nutritional value. Additionally, in another recipe for Sweet &amp; Sour Pork, carrots are halved lengthwise and used alongside onions and baby marrows. These uses highlight the versatility of carrots in culinary preparations, contributing to the dish's flavor, texture, and nutritional content.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1bea3aa6519bdbc96a177e5b01313158&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c30d19cfece6de65df0c2321c6c977c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92bd7d456fa9b5f0c564afd5dd3bb0af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25e31297f3300051fe4ba3bfefc44fd6</data>
