      <data key="d0">Cooking from the heart</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Cooking from the heart is a recipe book launched by iChange4Health to provide information and guidance regarding lifestyle changes, aimed at promoting healthier habits among South Africans.&lt;SEP&gt;Cooking from the heart is another community initiative designed to promote healthy eating habits and lifestyles.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9c3dada45a598da1af9a6c9dc041e660&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b7992edada8563b4687affa28b55ef3</data>
