    <node id="iChange4Health">
      <data key="d0">iChange4Health</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">iChange4Health is a community initiative aimed at promoting health and well-being through various programs.&lt;SEP&gt;iChange4Health is an initiative launched by Pharma Dynamics in collaboration with the Chronic Disease Initiative for Africa (CDIA) to help South Africans change their unhealthy habits and adopt healthier lifestyles.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9c3dada45a598da1af9a6c9dc041e660&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b7992edada8563b4687affa28b55ef3</data>
