      <data key="d0">ultra-processed foods</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Ultra-processed foods are highly manufactured with additives, often contain high levels of sugar, salt, and fat, and are typically associated with larger portions and less nutritional value compared to home-cooked meals.</data>
